WEBVTT

00:02:57.407 --> 00:03:00.310
She left some literature
lying around for him,

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.446
but when he didn't show much interest,

00:03:02.479 --> 00:03:05.015
she did what any other
sensible spouse would do.

00:03:05.615 --> 00:03:07.317
She left the book in the bathroom.

00:03:07.317 --> 00:03:08.485
(Laughter)

00:03:08.518 --> 00:03:09.653
And lo and behold,

00:03:09.686 --> 00:03:12.222
when he had run out
of other stuff to read in there,

00:03:12.222 --> 00:03:13.390
there was the book --

00:03:13.423 --> 00:03:15.325
“She’s Not There” by Jennifer Boylan.

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:20.030
This was the beginning of my dad
really trying to come around

00:03:20.063 --> 00:03:21.231
to me being transgender,

00:03:21.231 --> 00:03:23.433
and everyone in my family helped,

00:03:23.467 --> 00:03:26.336
including Jonas, who,
at no more than eight,

00:03:26.369 --> 00:03:28.205
walked up to my dad and said,

00:03:28.238 --> 00:03:29.372
"Face it.

00:03:29.873 --> 00:03:31.341
You have a son,